      "text": "🚨 ROAD ACCIDENT ALERT 🚨\nA lorry accident has been reported near Athvelly Masjid.\n\n🚔 Medchal Traffic Police are responding immediately and are on the way to the spot.\n\n⚠️ Traffic Advisory:\n• Drive slow in Athvelly stretch\n• Follow police instructions\n• Avoid unnecessary crowding at accident spot\n• Give way to emergency vehicles 🚑🚒\n\n🛑 Your patience saves lives.\nDrive responsibly. Arrive safely.\n\n#MedchalTrafficPolice #RoadSafety #DriveSafe #TrafficAlert\n#AccidentAlert #TelanganaTraffic #SaveLives #ArriveAlive\n#FollowTrafficRules #",
